{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a totally normal robot vacuum in a total normal human world. Clean messes, roll around the house, and experience life as a robot vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3rd person little adventure game you take on the responsibilities of being a robot vacuum! You'll roll around the house cleaning up messes, making sure to keep the house clean, then return to base to end the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean you might notice the owner of the house having conversations, perhaps they are important?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as a robot vacuum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cleaning messes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >listening in on conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and did I mention.. cleaning messes??</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish a level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3615590/ce91b429dd96f9303c7dd60e5e3ee1d1bac3c11a.jpg"},{"name":"S Rank a level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3615590/7ab92b60ed73c7f305ab705bbe87c3d079e5f5dc.jpg"},{"name":"Robo Vac V2 is here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3615590/a8153188cd0e9e45afce355c5d63e1a2a3798df0.jpg"},{"name":"See the true ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3615590/8daa5f4a6b02ffe8ffc4343198d0e4ff847b565e.jpg"},{"name":"Cutting it close!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3615590/d7ffb7a12686418853bd0a8640082055f38e7205.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615590?t=1746170004","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/36155